{"v":[[1,"The mighty God, even the Lord, hath spoken, and called the earth from the rising of the sun unto the going down thereof."],[2,"Out of Zion, the perfection of beauty, God hath shined."],[3,"Our God shall come, and shall not keep silence: a fire shall devour before him, and it shall be very tempestuous round about him."],[4,"He shall call to the heavens from above, and to the earth, that he may judge his people."],[5,"Gather my saints together unto me; those that have made a covenant with me by sacrifice."],[6,"And the heavens shall declare his righteousness: for God is judge himself. Selah."],[7,"Hear, O my people, and I will speak; O Israel, and I will testify against thee: I am God, even thy God."],[8,"I will not reprove thee for thy sacrifices or thy burnt offerings, to have been continually before me."],[9,"I will take no bullock out of thy house, nor he goats out of thy folds."],[10,"For every beast of the forest is mine, and the cattle upon a thousand hills."],[11,"I know all the fowls of the mountains: and the wild beasts of the field are mine."],[12,"If I were hungry, I would not tell thee: for the world is mine, and the fulness thereof."],[13,"Will I eat the flesh of bulls, or drink the blood of goats?"],[14,"Offer unto God thanksgiving; and pay thy vows unto the most High:"],[15,"And call upon me in the day of trouble: I will deliver thee, and thou shalt glorify me."],[16,"But unto the wicked God saith, What hast thou to do to declare my statutes, or that thou shouldest take my covenant in thy mouth?"],[17,"Seeing thou hatest instruction, and castest my words behind thee."],[18,"When thou sawest a thief, then thou consentedst with him, and hast been partaker with adulterers."],[19,"Thou givest thy mouth to evil, and thy tongue frameth deceit."],[20,"Thou sittest and speakest against thy brother; thou slanderest thine own mother’s son."],[21,"These things hast thou done, and I kept silence; thou thoughtest that I was altogether such an one as thyself: but I will reprove thee, and set them in order before thine eyes."],[22,"Now consider this, ye that forget God, lest I tear you in pieces, and there be none to deliver."],[23,"Whoso offereth praise glorifieth me: and to him that ordereth his conversation aright will I shew the salvation of God."]],"w":{"1":[["'el","God","H410"],["'elohim","God","H430"],["yahweh","Yahweh","H3068"],["diber","he has spoken","H1696"],["va-iyikra'","and he has summoned","H7121"],["'aretz","[the] earth","H776"],["mi-mizracho","from [the] rising of","H4217"],["shemesh","[the] sun","H8121"],["'ad","to","H5704"],["mevo'-o","setting its","H3996"]],"2":[["mi-tziyon","from Zion","H6726"],["mikhlal","perfection of","H4359"],["yofi","beauty","H3308"],["'elohim","God","H430"],["hofia'","he has shone forth","H3313"]],"3":[["yavo'","he comes","H935"],["'elohei-nu","God our","H430"],["ve-'al","and may not","H408"],["yecherash","he be silent","H2790"],["'esh","fire","H784"],["le-fana-v","<to> before him","H6440"],["tokhel","it consumes","H398"],["u-seviva-v","and around him","H5439"],["nis'arah","it is tempestuous","H8175"],["me'od","exceedingly","H3966"]],"4":[["yikra'","he summons","H7121"],["'el","<to>","H413"],["ha-shamayim","the heavens","H8064"],["me-'al","<from> above","H5920"],["ve-'el","and <to>","H413"],["ha-'aretz","the earth","H776"],["la-din","to judge","H1777"],["am-o","people his","H5971"]],"5":[["'isfu","gather","H622"],["l-i","to me",""],["chasida-i","O faithful [people] my","H2623"],["koretei","[those who] made","H3772"],["verit-i","<of> covenant my","H1285"],["'alei","with","H5921"],["zavach","sacrifice","H2077"]],"6":[["va-iyagidu","and they declared","H5046"],["shamayim","[the] heavens","H8064"],["tzidk-o","righteousness his","H6664"],["ki","for","H3588"],["'elohim","God","H430"],["shofet","[is] judge","H8199"],["hu'","he","H1931"],["selah","Selah","H5542"]],"7":[["shim'a-h","hear !","H8085"],["'am-i","O people my","H5971"],["va-'adaberah","so let me speak","H1696"],["yisra'el